#: ../../getting_started/guides/xaas_instance.rst:2
msgid "Creating XaaS Instance Types with |morpheus|"
msgstr "Creating XaaS Instance Types con |morpheus|"

#: ../../getting_started/guides/xaas_instance.rst:4
msgid ""
"|morpheus| version 5.4.2 and higher includes the ability to build and "
"provision XaaS Instance Types. These are non-VM backed Layouts which "
"allow users to represent anything as an Instance. This includes the "
"ability to utilize Provisioning Workflows to manage all phases of the "
"Instance lifecycles consistently and automatically. XaaS Instance Types "
"can also be tied into service plans to track costs or bill customers."
msgstr ""
"|morpheus| version 5.4.2 y higher includes the ability to build y "
"provision XaaS Instance Types. Estos son non-VM backed Layouts which "
"allow users to represent anything as an Instance. This includes the "
"ability to utilize Provisioning Workflows to manage all phases of the "
"Instance lifecycles consistently y automatically. XaaS Instance Types can"
" también be tied into service plans to track costs o bill customers."

#: ../../getting_started/guides/xaas_instance.rst:6
msgid ""
"In this specific example, we will create an XaaS Instance Type to manage "
"the lifecycle of folders within a Dropbox account. Users will be able to "
"visit the |morpheus| Catalog and have the folder created by entering a "
"name for the folder and clicking a single button. We'll see how each "
"folder is then represented as an Instance. With the Instance standing, "
"users will be able to update the folder name by simply editing a custom "
"value on the Instance. Finally, when the Instance is deleted, the folder "
"is deleted from Dropbox as well."
msgstr ""
"In this específico example, we will create an XaaS Instance Type to "
"manage the lifecycle of folders dentro de a Dropbox account. Users será "
"able to visit the |morpheus| Catalog y have the folder created by "
"entering a name for the folder y clicking a single button. We'll see how "
"cada folder is entonces represented as an Instance. With the Instance "
"standing, users será able para actualizar the folder name by simply "
"editing a personalizado value on the Instance. Finalmente, cuando el "
"Instance is deleted, the folder is deleted desde Dropbox as well."

