#: ../../getting_started/guides/xaas_instance.rst:85
msgid "Create Tasks"
msgstr "Create Tasks"

#: ../../getting_started/guides/xaas_instance.rst:87
msgid ""
"Tasks, in |morpheus|, are individual automation scripts. They can be "
"pieced together into Workflows (as we'll see later) to create more "
"comprehensive automation packages. They can be written in a number of "
"different languages (including BASH, Powershell, Python, Javascript, and "
"more) or to accomplish specific functions like restarting a server or "
"sending an email notification. In this case, I'll write the Task "
"configuration directly into the |morpheus| Tasks. However, Tasks can also"
" be sourced directly from integrated version control repositories (like "
"Github) so you never have to copy and paste code or make manual updates "
"when your code changes."
msgstr ""
"Tasks, in |morpheus|, are individual automation scripts. They puede ser "
"pieced together en Workflows (as we'll see later) crear more "
"comprehensive automation packages. They puede ser written in a number of "
"different languages (including BASH, Powershell, Python, Javascript, y "
"more) o to accomplish específico functions like restarting a server o "
"sending an email notification. En este caso, I'll write the Task "
"configuration directly en the |morpheus| Tasks. Sin embargo, Tasks can "
"also be sourced directly desde integrated version control repositories "
"(like Github) so you never have to copy y paste code o make manual "
"updates when your code changes."

#: ../../getting_started/guides/xaas_instance.rst:89
msgid ""
"For this example, we need to create four Tasks. One to create the folder,"
" one to rename the folder, one to rename the |morpheus| Instance, and one"
" to delete the folder. I've used Python Tasks to interact with the "
"Dropbox Python SDK. I won't go into how to write the individual Tasks "
"here but the Python SDK is well-documented if you want to try things out "
"for yourself. The same functions could be carried out using other Task "
"types as well."
msgstr ""
"For this example, we need para crear four Tasks. One para crear the "
"folder, one to rename the folder, one to rename the |morpheus| Instance, "
"y one to delete the folder. I've used Python Tasks to interact con the "
"Dropbox Python SDK. I won't go en how to write the individual Tasks here "
"pero the Python SDK is well-documented if you want to try things out for "
"yourself. The mismo functions could be carried out using otros Task types"
" as well."

